      "writtenOn": "2022-12-16T07:00:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This looks wrong.\n\nIt looks like if USB_VID_USB_C_MONITOR is defined, for any mode entry, regardless of mode, we would never do the chipset_in_state check...\n\nThis looks like a potential regression of what\u0027s described in the comment above whenever this Acer alternate mode is enabled.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1041,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1052,
        "endChar": 6
      },
      "revId": "7efbc3fbd90a346b4c47e84a839383295cd6e36f",
