        "id": 1329118
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-12-16T07:14:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The original behavior will be \"Do not try to enter mode while CPU is off\". But if we need to support Acer VDM command to power on DUT, we need to enter Acer mode when DUT in S5. And then we can get Acer specific VDM command when press monitor\u0027s power button.",
      "parentUuid": "b0e31afb_4d301ea0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1041,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 1052,
        "endChar": 6
